  "brain_first": "“句子主干如果像少了一个‘它/自己/助动词’，再考虑这一 类。”",
  "sort_order": 1058,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2477
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "少数空不是冠词/介词/连词，而是代词、助动词、",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2478
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "强调/固定结构小词。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2479
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2480
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Function words 包括代词、be/do/have、情态和",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2481
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "固定结构词。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2482
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “句子主干如果像少了一个‘它/自己/助动词’，再考虑这一",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2483
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "类。”",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2484
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这类频率低于核心几类，但不能完全漏。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2485
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2486
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 检查主语/宾语是否缺代词。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2487
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 检查被动/进行/完成结构是否缺 be/have。",
      "sourcePage": 89,
      "sourceIndex": 2488
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查强调/形式主语：it。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2489
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 检查固定结构：so...that, too...to, either...or 等。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2490
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2491
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2492
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2493
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· It is + adj + to do / that...",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2494
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· There is/are...",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2495
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· do/does/did 可用于强调谓语，但语法填空较低频",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2496
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 填入后主干结构完整且语义自然。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2497
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 只有在冠词/介词/连词都不成立后再检查这一类，避免过度复杂化。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2498
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2499
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "___ is important to check the source before sharing news. 形式主语 → It。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2500
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2501
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 一上来就猜情态动词。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2502
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忽略固定结构。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2503
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2504
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 句子主干完整了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2505
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 是不是固定结构的一部分？",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2506
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2507
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2508
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2509
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 小词最后查：代词、助动、固定结构。",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2510
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2512
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. It is raining, ___? 需要助动词结构时先看？",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2513
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. ___ are two reasons.",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2514
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 固定结构“not only... ___ also...”",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2515
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 代词空先检查？",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2516
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 情态动词后动词形式？",
      "sourcePage": 90,
      "sourceIndex": 2517
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 主句谓语/时态和句型。；2. There；3. but；4. 指代对象+格/数。；5. 原形。",
      "sourcePage": 91,
      "sourceIndex": 2518
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF10 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF10”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 91,
      "sourceIndex": 2519
    }
  ],
